 "stimulus_html": "Evaluate the following exponential expressions.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 509653,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"3 \\times {2^5} + 5 \\times {8^2}\">3 \\times {2^5} + 5 \\times {8^2}</span>\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"3 \\times {2^5} + 5 \\times {8^2}\"></span></p>\n<p>Use the order of expressions (PEMDAS), which means</p>\n<p>do the exponents first,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"3 \\times 32 + 5 \\times 64\"></span></p>\n<p>then multiplications,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"96 + 320\"></span></p>\n<p>then additions.</p>\n<p>416</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "416"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 509654,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"5 \\times {7^3} + 2 \\times {7^2} + 5 \\times {7^1} + 3 \\times {7^0}\">5 \\times {7^3} + 2 \\times {7^2} + 5 \\times {7^1} + 3 \\times {7^0}</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"5 \\times {7^3} + 2 \\times {7^2} + 5 \\times {7^1} + 3 \\times {7^0}\"></span></p>\n<p>Remember that any base raised to the exponent 0 is 1.</p>\n<p>Use the order of expressions (PEMDAS), which means</p>\n<p>do the exponents first,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"5 \\times 343 + 2 \\times 49 + 5 \\times 7 + 3 \\times 1\"></span></p>\n<p>then multiplications,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"1,715 + 98 + 35 + 3\"></span></p>\n<p>then additions.</p>\n<p>1,851</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "1,851"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 509655,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"1 \\times {10^4} + 7 \\times {10^3} + 4 \\times {10^2} + 8 \\times {10^1} + 8 \\times {10^0}\">1 \\times {10^4} + 7 \\times {10^3} + 4 \\times {10^2} + 8 \\times {10^1} + 8 \\times {10^0}</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"1 \\times {10^4} + 7 \\times {10^3} + 4 \\times {10^2} + 8 \\times {10^1} + 8 \\times {10^0}\"></span></p>\n<p>Remember that any base raised to the exponent 0 is 1.</p>\n<p>Use the order of expressions (PEMDAS), which means</p>\n<p>do the exponents first,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"1 \\times 10,000 + 7 \\times 1,000 + 4 \\times 100 + 8 \\times 10 + 8 \\times 1\"></span></p>\n<p>then multiplications,</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"10,000 + 7,000 + 400 + 80 + 8\"></span></p>\n<p>then additions.</p>\n<p>17,488</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "17,488"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
